<title>NETHERLANDS: TEXTIELGROEP TWENTHE CUTS 1996 NET LOSS.</title>
<headline>TEXTIELGROEP TWENTHE CUTS 1996 NET LOSS.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net loss				 0.5  vs  10.6</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)		  nil  vs  nil</p>
<p>    Turnover				83.6  vs 109.1</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     0.6  vs   3.0 loss</p>
<p>    Interest charges		     1.5  vs   2.1</p>
<p>    Tax					nil  vs   1.6</p>
<p>    Extraordinary gain		   0.4  vs   7.0 charge</p>
<p>NOTE - Textiles firm Textielgroep Twenthe NV said in August</p>
<p>it expected a loss in 1996 despite a sharp recovery of results.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
